# Issue #46 batches 3b and 4: summon gadgets and charge gadgets (Penny, Bea, Grom, Janet, Stu, Tara, Charlie, Ruffs, Leon's
# clone, Rico's container; Wendy, Glowy, Bolt, Brock, Max, Shelly, Angelo; Maisie's stun and Clancy's reload on their
# dashes). A diff on top of the other patches (after masked_seven.patch). Paths relative to engine/.
# gadget.c: the SUMMON kind (spawn rows whose CustomObject is a characters.csv row: libg's summon factory 0xb56e00 at the
# brawler, or CustomValue1 of them CustomValue2 out for SubType 5; Tara's shadows retired after CustomValue3 ticks, Ruffs'
# sandbags at CustomValue4 % of his max HP, Grom's tower answers the bush hiding through gadget_summon_vision), Type 76
# (Rico) taken as a SHOT, the CHARGE kind (a Charge skill, or activate_skill's CustomObject skill, through env.c's new
# env_charge_start: the native charge with the skill's ChargeType, no super slot, areas at take-off / landing, the skill's
# ActivationSelfStatusEffects and Reload flag), DASH extras (a row's AreaEffect at the start, SubType 3's ammo) and a
# ready() for DASH / CHARGE (not mid-charge). gadget_self.c: gadget_vision asks gadget_summon_vision. superfix.c: a summon's
# Damage / Dot area with DamageScaleType 1 takes the summoner's weapon Damage, and its Dot area re-applies every 20 ticks.
# env.c: env_charge_start, a gadget charge's job spawns only its end area at the landing and ends its CancelOnChargeEnd
# statuses (superfix_status.c's new superfix_status_charge_end, which my_charge_end now calls), and env_on_build empties
# the charge job table (character ids restart in a new battle).
# Re-recorded for the linear chain (series): applies with -p1 on the tree the patches before it in series leave.
